[{"answer":"So Luke, for our next psychology assignment we have to do something on sleep and dreams.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I've just read an article suggesting why we tend to forget most of our dreams soon after we wake up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, most of my dreams aren't that interesting anyway,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/4.mp3"},{"answer":"but what it said was that if we remembered everything,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/5.mp3"},{"answer":"we might get mixed up about what actually happened and what we dreamed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/6.mp3"},{"answer":"So it's a sort of protection.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I hadn't heard that idea before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd always assumed that it was just that we didn't have room in our memories for all that stuff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/10.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think about the idea that our dreams may predict the future?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/11.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a belief that you get all over the world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, lots of people have a story of it happening to them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/13.mp3"},{"answer":"but the explanation I've read is that for each dream that comes true,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/14.mp3"},{"answer":"we have thousands that don't, but we don't notice those,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/15.mp3"},{"answer":"we don't even remember them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/16.mp3"},{"answer":"We just remember the ones where something in the real world,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/17.mp3"},{"answer":"like a view or an action, happens to trigger a dream memory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/19.mp3"},{"answer":"So it's just a coincidence really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Something else I read about is what they call segmented sleeping.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/21.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a theory that hundreds of years ago,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/22.mp3"},{"answer":"people used to get up in the middle of the night and have a chat or something to eat,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/23.mp3"},{"answer":"then go back to bed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/24.mp3"},{"answer":"So I tried it myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Why?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Well it's meant to make you more creative.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know why.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/28.mp3"},{"answer":"But I gave it up after a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/29.mp3"},{"answer":"It just didn't fit in with my lifestyle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/30.mp3"},{"answer":"But most pre-school children have a short sleep in the day don't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/31.mp3"},{"answer":"There was an experiment some students did here last term to see at what age kids should stop having naps.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/32.mp3"},{"answer":"But they didn't really find an answer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/33.mp3"},{"answer":"They spent a lot of time working out the most appropriate methodology,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/34.mp3"},{"answer":"but the results didn't seem to show any obvious patterns.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/36-2024-08-25-19-47-50.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, let's think about our assignment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Last time I had problems with the final stage,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/38.mp3"},{"answer":"where we had to describe and justify how successful we thought we'd been.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I struggled a bit with the action plan too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I was OK with the planning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/41.mp3"},{"answer":"but I got marked down for the self-assessment as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/42.mp3"},{"answer":"And I had big problems with the statistical stuff,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/43.mp3"},{"answer":"that's where I really lost marks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/45.mp3"},{"answer":"So shall we plan what we have to do for this assignment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/46.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/47.mp3"},{"answer":"First, we have to decide on our research question.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/48.mp3"},{"answer":"So how about 'Is there a relationship between hours of sleep and number of dreams?'","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/49.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we need to think about who we'll do the study on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/51.mp3"},{"answer":"About 12 people?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/53.mp3"},{"answer":"And shall we use other psychology students?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's use people from a different department.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/55.mp3"},{"answer":"What about history?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, they might have interesting dreams!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Or literature students?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/58.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't really know any.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/59.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, forget that idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we have to think about our methodology.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/61.mp3"},{"answer":"So we could use observation,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/62.mp3"},{"answer":"but that doesn't seem appropriate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/63.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/64.mp3"},{"answer":"it needs to be self-reporting I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/65.mp3"},{"answer":"And we could ask them to answer questions online.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/66.mp3"},{"answer":"But in this case, paper might be better","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/67.mp3"},{"answer":"as they'll be doing it straight after they wake up...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/68.mp3"},{"answer":"in fact while they're still half-asleep.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/70.mp3"},{"answer":"And we'll have to check the ethical guidelines for this sort of research.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Because our experiment involves humans, so there are special regulations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/73.mp3"},{"answer":"I had a look at those for another assignment I did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/74.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a whole section on risk assessment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/75.mp3"},{"answer":"and another section on making sure they aren't put under any unnecessary stress.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's hope they don't have any bad dreams!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Then when we've collected all our data we have to analyse it","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/79.mp3"},{"answer":"and calculate the correlation between our two variables,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/80.mp3"},{"answer":"that's time sleeping and number of dreams","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/81.mp3"},{"answer":"and then present our results visually in a graph.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. And the final thing is to think about our research and evaluate it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/83.mp3"},{"answer":"So that seems quite straightforward.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. So now let's...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-3-2022-12-31-23-06-59/85.mp3"}]
